WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In 1942 a dentist proposed using bats to deliver incendiaries.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers tested a chain of aircraft, containers and animal behavior.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A 1943 test incident set American facilities on fire.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The program ended in 1944 without combat use. A test is not a deployment.
